# Burden of Proof has flash (CR 702.8a): Bot1 casts it during the declare blockers step on Bot2's Grizzly Bears, which has just blocked Bot1's Novice Inspector.
# The Bears become 1/1 and can no longer block Detectives, but the Inspector stays blocked (CR 506.4; the 2024-02-02 ruling): it deals its 1 damage to the
# Bears instead of Bot2 taking it, and kills the 1/1, while the Bears' 1 damage doesn't kill the 1/2 Inspector.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Novice Inspector
Burden of Proof
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Grizzly Bears
Island x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Novice Inspector.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Grizzly Bears.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Novice Inspector > Bot2)
Bot2.Block(Grizzly Bears > Novice Inspector)
[T3 Bot1.DeclareBlockers]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Burden of Proof.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears.Power = 1
? Bot2.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears.Toughness = 1
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot2.Graveyard = Grizzly Bears
Bot1.Graveyard = Burden of Proof
Bot1.Battlefield.Novice Inspector.Damage = 1
